  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Silence! Your fumbling has at least inspired me. What if we used that Scholomari incantation to lay an ambush?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_076.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "With that Gargoyle Dust poultice and the words, I may be able to fabricate a spell that allows a mortal to assume a temporary stone form.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_077.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The dust is easy enough to acquire. As you know, it can be found all over the city from when we shed our stone forms at night.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_078.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But where do we find a mortal at this hour? Truly, you think you can manage it? This I cannot wait to see. Very well, then we just need a place to spring our trap.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_079.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Hmm, yes. Gather Gargoyle Dust, then direct Lucy Easton to our Safehouse and return to me here.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_080.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC16C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "*Cough Cough* Oh, hello again friend. I must apologize for my weariness. But at this late hour-",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Vampire_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-GRAVE_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675666,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC08A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Child, it is barely midnight!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Vampire_Base_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lord_Arthur_Easton_DM-GRAVE_026.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704023,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC16C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "A safehouse? Oh, that does sound grand. Perhaps... perhaps I can finally get some rest.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Vampire_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-GRAVE_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675666,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC08A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I will guide her to this Safehouse, friend. You inform the commander.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Vampire_Base_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lord_Arthur_Easton_DM-GRAVE_027.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704023,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My Underwings tell me the Eastons are en route to the Safehouse. I will meet them there. The ambush is up to you. Did you find a mortal?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_081.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What did you promise them? Eternal life? A place in the House of Swords? They are so gullible.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_082.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Take your conscripted daywalker to the Safehouse and use this poultice to transform them into a Gargoyle. From there, they must watch.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_083.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If the Broken Branch are clever, they won't be wandering about in their telltale garb, but blending in with the daywalking Weres.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_084.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Remember what we know of them:",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_085.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They froze my previous sentry into stone; your mortal should mind any who approach them.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_086.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Broken Branch wield strange incantations using unfamiliar words.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_087.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And they will be seeking Lucy, who is guarded by my forces.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_088.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Listen to what they say, see where they go, find the Broken Branch and stop them from reaching the Safehouse.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_089.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So all that time, those rituals, the potions, everything the Broken Branch was doing... was to make us mortal again.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_092.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
